error[E0602]: a value of type [AtomicInt64, int32] is not transferable, so it cannot be given to a parallel item
 --> $DIR/handle-nested-item.nra:9:13
  |
9 | ...  let _ = parallel.map<[atomics.AtomicInt64, int], int64>([[counter, 1]], bump, parallel.l...
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not transferable
  |
  = note: a value of type [AtomicInt64, int32] holds a value of type AtomicInt64
  = note: tasks share a Std.Concurrent handle, but a parallel item runs in a heap of its own and receives copies, so a handle cannot enter one

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0602`.
